<Platform title="Privacy & Data" description="How Digivated uses project submissions, purchase access, browser storage, and site analytics.">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Digivated</p><h1>Privacy &amp; Data</h1><p class="lede">A practical guide to the information used by this site.</p></header>
  <article class="article-body"><h2>Project submissions</h2><p>The submission form collects your creator name, email, project details, and any image or social link you provide. Submissions go through review before publication. Approved project details are public; your submission email is not displayed on the project card. If you sign in with a verified email, new submissions can be linked to your account. Your submission status and any owner review feedback appear only to that verified email. Sign-in links and sessions are handled by Supabase Auth.</p><h2>Purchase access and browser storage</h2><p>Prompt Packet purchases are handled by Gumroad. Digivated verifies purchase access with Gumroad and uses an HttpOnly session cookie for access. Personal toolkit notes, favorites, and progress are stored in your browser. Use the toolkit’s export controls to keep your own copy.</p><h2>Packet trial feedback</h2><p>The optional packet feedback form collects a display name, the task you tried, your result, and anything you found confusing. Leave out private project information. Feedback is stored for owner review and is private unless you explicitly allow a public quote. Permission is optional and unchecked by default. Consented feedback is published only after review and may appear with the display name you provide. To request removal, contact Digivated through the link below.</p><h2>Analytics and diagnostics</h2><p>The site uses Google Analytics for visitor analytics and Sentry for technical diagnostics. Project view counts are approximate and use network-based deduplication. External project websites and linked services have their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Questions or corrections</h2><p>For questions about a listed project or information you submitted, contact <a href="https://x.com/digivatedx" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Digivated on X</a>.</p></article>
</Platform>
